{"status": 200, "url_final": "https://steelspine.ai/", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"uQzTm_o_oS13wqaPjKseADKRwDT-EoA8TTLrgAe8xE8\" />\n  <title>SteelSpine AI \u2014 Tamper-Evident AI Agent Audit Trail &amp; Observability</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tamper-evident AI agent audit trail, deterministic replay, and persistent memory. Cryptographically signed AI logs for AI agent observability and EU AI Act Article 12 logging. Works with Claude Code, Cursor, Docker, Git, and 50+ OTEL frameworks.\">\n  <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"AI agent audit trail, tamper-evident AI logs, AI agent observability, EU AI Act Article 12 logging, AI agent replay, cryptographically signed audit chain\">\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://steelspine.ai/\" />\n\n  <!-- Open Graph -->\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"SteelSpine AI\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://steelspine.ai/\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"SteelSpine AI \u2014 Tamper-Evident AI Agent Audit Trail &amp; Observability\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Cryptographically signed audit chain plus deterministic replay plus persistent memory. AI agent observability + EU AI Act Article 12 logging ready. Multi-vendor. Local-first.\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://steelspine.ai/img/steelspine_logo_transparent.png\" />\n\n  <!-- Twitter Card -->\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n  <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"SteelSpine AI \u2014 Tamper-Evident AI Agent Audit Trail &amp; Observability\" />\n  <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Cryptographically signed audit chain plus deterministic replay plus persistent memory. AI agent observability + EU AI Act Article 12 logging ready.\" />\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://steelspine.ai/img/steelspine_logo_transparent.png\" />\n\n  <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"img/steelspine_logo_transparent.png\" />\n\n  <!-- Structured data -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n  {\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"name\": \"SteelSpine AI\",\n    \"url\": \"https://steelspine.ai/\",\n    \"logo\": \"https://steelspine.ai/img/steelspine_logo_transparent.png\",\n    \"description\": \"Tamper-evident audit trail, deterministic replay, and persistent memory infrastructure for AI agents.\",\n    \"founder\": \"Felps Enterprises Inc.\"\n  }\n  </script>\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n  {\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"SoftwareApplication\",\n    \"name\": \"SteelSpine AI\",\n    \"applicationCategory\": \"DeveloperApplication\",\n    \"operatingSystem\": \"macOS, Linux, Windows\",\n    \"url\": \"https://steelspine.ai/\",\n    \"description\": \"Tamper-evident AI agent audit trail with cryptographically signed logs, deterministic replay, and persistent memory. Built for AI agent observability and EU AI Act Article 12 logging. Works with Claude Code, Cursor, Docker, Git, and 50+ OpenTelemetry frameworks.\",\n    \"offers\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      \"price\": \"0\",\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"CAD\"\n    }\n  }\n  </script>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/site.css\" />\n  <style>\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Tier divider \u2500\u2500 */\n    .tier-divider {\n      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px;\n      padding: 64px 0 16px;\n      max-width: var(--max); margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 32px; padding-right: 32px;\n    }\n    .tier-divider-line {\n      flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--border2);\n    }\n    .tier-divider-label {\n      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2.5px;\n      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dim);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Gist cards \u2500\u2500 */\n    .gist-grid {\n      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px;\n      margin-top: 40px;\n    }\n    .gist-card {\n      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: var(--r-lg); padding: 32px 28px;\n      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\n    }\n    .gist-num {\n      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px;\n      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--purple);\n    }\n    .gist-title {\n      font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text);\n      line-height: 1.2;\n    }\n    .gist-body {\n      font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65;\n    }\n    .gist-pill {\n      display: inline-block; margin-top: 4px;\n      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--green);\n      background: rgba(52,211,153,.08); border: 1px solid rgba(52,211,153,.2);\n      border-radius: 20px; padding: 4px 12px;\n      align-self: flex-start;\n    }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Simple nav (scanner tier) \u2500\u2500 */\n    .nav-links .nav-divider { color: var(--border2); }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Technical break section \u2500\u2500 */\n    .tech-intro {\n      padding: 80px 0 0;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 680px) {\n      .gist-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n      .vs-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }\n    }\n\n    /* \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\n       SCROLL SNAP \u2014 PPT-style section transitions\n       Desktop: mandatory (always snaps to section)\n       Mobile:  proximity (snaps when close, not forced)\n    \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550 */\n    html { scroll-snap-type: y mandatory; scroll-padding-top: var(--nav-h); }\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      html { scroll-snap-type: y proximity; }\n    }\n\n    /* Cinematic screens \u2014 hard stop */\n    .splash, .why {\n      scroll-snap-align: start;\n      scroll-snap-stop: always;\n    }\n\n    /* Hero fills viewport */\n    .hero {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      scroll-snap-align: start;\n      scroll-snap-stop: always;\n      display: flex !important;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 80px 0;\n    }\n    .hero .container { width: 100%; position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n\n    /* Stat strip fills viewport */\n    .stat-strip {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex !important;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: center;\n      scroll-snap-align: start;\n    }\n\n    /* Generic snap section */\n    .snap {\n      scroll-snap-align: start;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex !important;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 56px 0;\n    }\n    .snap.bg-alt { background: var(--bg2); }\n    .snap .container { width: 100%; }\n\n    /* CTA band + footer \u2014 one snap screen */\n    .cta-footer-screen {\n      scroll-snap-align: start;\n      height: calc(100vh - var(--nav-h));\n      display: flex !important;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .cta-band {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex !important;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    /* SOLUTION section \u2014 snap to top, scroll freely through */\n    #solution { scroll-snap-align: start; }\n\n    /* COMMANDS section \u2014 full viewport slide */\n    #commands {\n      scroll-snap-align: start;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex !important;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    .cmd-groups { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }\n    .cmd-group-hdr {\n      display: block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px;\n      text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; padding-bottom: 6px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n    .cmd-group-tools .cmd-group-hdr { color: var(--dim); }\n    .cmd-group-tools .cmd-card { opacity: .6; }\n    .cmd-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; }\n    .cmd-row .cmd-group { flex: 1; }\n    .cmd-row .cmd-group-remember { flex: 0 0 200px; }\n    .cmd-group-remember .cmd-card { height: 100%; }\n\n    /* Reduce base section padding so content fits viewport */\n    .section { padding: 56px 0; }\n    .tech-intro { padding-top: 56px; }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Stat animations \u2500\u2500 */\n    @keyframes stat-fire {\n      0%, 100% { text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255,40,0,0.55), 0 0 40px rgba(255,80,0,0.2); }\n      45%       { text-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(255,80,0,1),    0 0 70px rgba(255,40,0,0.55), 0 0 100px rgba(255,20,0,0.2); }\n    }\n    @keyframes stat-warn {\n      0%, 100% { text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255,160,0,0.4); }\n      50%       { text-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(255,180,0,0.85), 0 0 55px rgba(255,140,0,0.35); }\n    }\n    @keyframes stat-flash {\n      0%, 55%, 100% { color: #00e676; text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0,230,118,0.3); }\n      65%, 88%      { color: #80ffbc; text-shadow: 0 0 36px rgba(0,230,118,1), 0 0 72px rgba(0,255,140,0.65); }\n    }\n    .stat-fire { animation: stat-fire 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }\n    .stat-warn { animation: stat-warn 2.8s ease-in-out infinite; }\n    .stat-flash { animation: stat-flash 3s ease-in-out infinite; }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Logo animation class (nav + footer) \u2500\u2500 */\n    .logo-animated {\n      animation: logo-sunbeam 4s ease-in-out infinite;\n      animation-delay: 1.2s;\n      will-change: filter;\n    }\n    .logo-animated:hover {\n      animation: none;\n      filter: brightness(1.25) drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(167,139,250,.7));\n      transition: filter .25s ease;\n    }\n\n    /* Footer bottom text */\n    .footer-bottom { text-align: center; }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Splash screen \u2500\u2500 */\n    .splash {\n      position: relative;\n      height: 100vh; width: 100%;\n      background: #000;\n      display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n      overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .splash::before {\n      content: '';\n      position: absolute; inset: 0;\n      background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 50% 50%, rgba(167,139,250,.045) 0%, transparent 70%);\n      pointer-events: none;\n    }\n    .splash-tagline {\n      font-size: clamp(13px, 1.8vw, 18px);\n      font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .22em;\n      text-transform: uppercase; color: #8a96ad;\n      text-align: center; margin-bottom: 44px;\n      animation: ss-fade-up 1s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) .2s both;\n    }\n    .splash-logo {\n      width: clamp(220px, 34vw, 420px); height: auto; display: block;\n      animation: ss-entrance 1.4s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both,\n                 ss-pulse 5s ease-in-out 2s infinite;\n      will-change: filter, opacity, transform;\n    }\n    .splash-sub {\n      font-size: clamp(13px, 1.8vw, 18px);\n      font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .18em;\n      text-transform: uppercase; color: #8a96ad;\n      text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\n      animation: ss-fade-up 1.8s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) .6s both;\n    }\n    .splash-scroll {\n      position: absolute; bottom: 36px; left: 50%;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .2em;\n      text-transform: uppercase; color: #3a4255;\n      animation: ss-scroll-appear 2.5s ease forwards, ss-scroll-blink 3s ease 2.5s infinite;\n      user-select: none; pointer-events: none;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    @keyframes ss-entrance {\n      0%   { opacity: 0; transform: scale(.88); }\n      60%  { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.02); }\n      100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }\n    }\n    @keyframes ss-pulse {\n      0%   { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 0px rgba(167,139,250,0)); }\n      25%  { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 18px rgba(167,139,250,.5)) drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(52,211,153,.2)); }\n      55%  { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(96,165,250,.4)) drop-shadow(0 0 22px rgba(167,139,250,.3)); }\n      80%  { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(52,211,153,.45)) drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(167,139,250,.25)); }\n      100% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 0px rgba(167,139,250,0)); }\n    }\n    @keyframes ss-fade-up {\n      0%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\n      100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n    }\n    @keyframes ss-scroll-appear {\n      0%, 75% { opacity: 0; }\n      100%    { opacity: 1; }\n    }\n    @keyframes ss-scroll-blink {\n      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n      50%       { opacity: .3; }\n    }\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Why screen \u2500\u2500 */\n    .why {\n      position: relative;\n      min-height: 100vh; width: 100%;\n      background: #000;\n      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n      padding: 64px 24px;\n    }\n    .why::before {\n      content: '';\n      position: absolute; inset: 0;\n      background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 40%, rgba(167,139,250,.04) 0%, transparent 70%);\n      pointer-events: none;\n    }\n    .why-wrap {\n      max-width: 620px; width: 100%; position: relative; z-index: 1;\n      animation: why-in .9s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both;\n    }\n    @keyframes why-in {\n      0%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); }\n      100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n    }\n    .why-hook {\n      font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 46px); font-weight: 800;\n      line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.025em;\n      color: #fff; margin-bottom: 36px;\n    }\n    .why-hook em {\n      font-style: normal; color: #a78bfa;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(167,139,250,.55), 0 0 48px rgba(167,139,250,.2);\n    }\n    .why-lines {\n      list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;\n      margin-bottom: 48px;\n    }\n    .why-lines li {\n      display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px;\n      font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 18px); color: #7c8899; line-height: 1.5;\n      animation: why-in .9s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both;\n    }\n    .why-lines li:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: .15s; }\n    .why-lines li:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .28s; }\n    .why-lines li:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .41s; }\n    .why-lines .wnum {\n      flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\n      color: #a78bfa; letter-spacing: .08em; padding-top: 3px;\n    }\n    .why-lines li strong { color: #e2e8f4; font-weight: 600; }\n    .why-verdict {\n      font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 17px); color: #3d4559;\n      margin-bottom: 48px; line-height: 1.6;\n      animation: why-in .9s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) .54s both;\n    }\n    .why-verdict strong { color: #7c8899; }\n    .why-ctas {\n      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;\n      animation: why-in .9s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) .66s both;\n    }\n    .why-btn {\n      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\n      padding: 14px 32px; background: #a78bfa; color: #fff;\n      font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 8px;\n      text-decoration: none; transition: background .15s, transform .15s;\n    }\n    .why-btn:hover { background: #9173e8; transform: translateY(-1px); opacity: 1; }\n    .why-skip {\n      font-size: 14px; color: #3a4255; text-decoration: none;\n      letter-spacing: .04em; transition: color .15s;\n    }\n    .why-skip:hover { color: #7c8899; opacity: 1; }\n  </style>\n  <script src=\"js/site_helpers.js\"></script>\n  <!-- ANALYTICS: Plausible (cookieless, no consent banner needed \u2014 on-brand for privacy/compliance audience).\n       data-domain is already correct; the ONLY Jeremy step is to sign up at plausible.io and add site \"steelspine.ai\"\n       so the dashboard starts receiving these events. No account-id/key needs pasting \u2014 Plausible keys off the domain.\n       script.outbound-links.js auto-tracks clicks to GitHub/external CTAs. Remove this block to disable. -->\n  <script defer data-domain=\"steelspine.ai\" src=\"https://plausible.io/js/script.outbound-links.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550 -->\n<!--  SCREEN 1 \u2014 CINEMATIC SPLASH                                   -->\n<!-- \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550 -->\n<section class=\"splash\" id=\"splash\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('chooser').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})\">\n  <p class=\"splash-eu-badge\" style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c79bff;margin-bottom:18px;font-weight:700;\">\n    Debug AI agents \u00b7 Capture \u00b7 Compare \u00b7 Replay\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"splash-tagline\">Wrap any agent in one command.</p>\n  <img src=\"img/steelspine_logo_transparent.png\" alt=\"SteelSpine AI logo \u2014 tamper-evident AI agent audit trail\" class=\"splash-logo\" />\n  <p class=\"splash-sub\">Capture every event. Compare runs. Replay from any state.</p>\n  <p class=\"splash-sub-2\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(232,216,255,0.7);margin-top:6px;\">Cryptographically signed end-to-end. SOC 2 Type II + EU AI Act Article 12 ready.</p>\n  <span class=\"splash-scroll\">Scroll to continue \u2193</span>\n</section>\n\n\n<div id=\"main-content\"></div>\n\n<!-- NAV -->\n<nav class=\"nav\">\n  <div class=\"nav-inner\">\n    <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"nav-brand\">\n      <img src=\"img/steelspine_logo_transparent.png\" alt=\"SteelSpine AI\" height=\"44\" class=\"logo-animated\" />\n    </a>\n    <ul class=\"nav-links\">\n      <li><a href=\"#infrastructure\">How it works</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#chooser\">Streams</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/compliance/\">Compliance</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/verify/\">Verify</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/docs/\">Docs</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/getting-started.html\">Get Started</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"mailto:hello@steelspine.ai\">Contact</a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <a href=\"#chooser\" class=\"btn btn-primary nav-cta\">Pick your stream</a>\n    <button class=\"nav-hamburger\" aria-label=\"Menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span></span><span></span><span></span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n\n\n<!-- REGULATORY URGENCY BANNER -->\n<div class=\"reg-urgency-banner\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1a0a2e 0%,#2d1244 50%,#1a0a2e 100%);border-bottom:1px solid #6a3aa8;padding:14px 0;text-align:center;\">\n  <div class=\"container\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:#e8d8ff;\">\n    <strong style=\"color:#c79bff;letter-spacing:0.06em;\">SOC 2 Type II + EU AI Act</strong>\n    <span style=\"opacity:0.9;\">audit-trail evidence \u00b7</span>\n    <span style=\"opacity:0.7;\">cryptographically signed, independently verifiable infrastructure</span>\n    <a href=\"/compliance/\" style=\"color:#c79bff;text-decoration:underline;\">for compliance teams \u2192</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"hero-glow\"></div>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"hero-eyebrow\">AUDIT \u00b7 REPLAY \u00b7 MEMORY INFRASTRUCTURE FOR AI</div>\n    <h1 class=\"hero-h1\">\n      What did your<br/>\n      <em class=\"hero-accent\">AI do?</em>\n    </h1>\n    <p class=\"hero-lead\">\n      Cryptographic audit chain. Deterministic replay.<br/>\n      Persistent memory. <strong>For any AI agent, anywhere.</strong>\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n      <a href=\"#chooser\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Pick your stream \u2193</a>\n      <a href=\"#infrastructure\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\">How it works \u2193</a>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"margin-top:18px;color:#aaa;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;text-align:center;\">\n      Five audience streams below. Each has setup, pricing, and demos specific to you.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- INFRASTRUCTURE \u2014 more than capture -->\n<section class=\"section snap bg-alt\" id=\"infrastructure\" style=\"padding-top:60px;padding-bottom:60px;\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Beyond Capture</p>\n    <h2 class=\"section-h2\">Infrastructure for AI agents.<br/>Not a logging library.</h2>\n    <p class=\"section-lead\" style=\"margin-bottom:42px;\">\n      The CLI capture-and-audit loop is just the first 10% of what SteelSpine does. Underneath it is a five-layer infrastructure stack \u2014 every piece runs locally, no cloud dependency, no vendor lock-in.\n    </p>\n\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:18px;max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;\">\n\n      <div style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.18);border-radius:12px;padding:24px 22px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.10em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c79bff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;\">Layer 1</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:8px;\">Capture &amp; Replay</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:12px;\">Wrap any agent or command. Stream stdout/stderr to a hash-chained event log. Replay offline against any captured state.</p>\n        <code style=\"font-size:11px;color:#c79bff;background:#0f0820;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;\">steelspine run \u00b7 replay-run \u00b7 branch-create</code>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.18);border-radius:12px;padding:24px 22px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.10em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c79bff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;\">Layer 2</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:8px;\">Cryptographic Audit</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:12px;\">HMAC-SHA256 + Ed25519 chain. Tamper-evident. Independently verifiable by an auditor with just the public key. Produces Article 12-ready tamper-evident audit records out of the box. Optional hardening: <code style=\"font-size:11px;color:#c79bff;\">compliance_mode</code> auto-enables RFC 3161 timestamping via eIDAS-accredited TSA. The integrity layer is classical (HMAC-SHA256 + Ed25519); it is not quantum-resistant. Tamper-evidence plus independent verification protect integrity-after-capture and let a third party verify; because the signing key is held by the operator, this is not non-repudiation against the operator \u2014 key custody (HSM / KMS / third-party timestamping) is the control for that.</p>\n        <code style=\"font-size:11px;color:#c79bff;background:#0f0820;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;\">verify-run \u00b7 pack-create \u00b7 pack-verify</code>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.18);border-radius:12px;padding:24px 22px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.10em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c79bff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;\">Layer 3</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:8px;\">Persistent Memory</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:12px;\">Transparent proxy in front of any OpenAI-compatible LLM. Auto-injects relevant context into every prompt. Promotes durable facts to long-term entity store. <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">The same agent remembers across sessions.</strong></p>\n        <code style=\"font-size:11px;color:#c79bff;background:#0f0820;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;\">memory-agent \u00b7 memory recall \u00b7 entities</code>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.18);border-radius:12px;padding:24px 22px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.10em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c79bff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;\">Layer 4</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:8px;\">Adapters, OTEL &amp; MCP</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">OpenTelemetry receiver</strong> for LangChain, LlamaIndex, CrewAI, Claude Code, and 50+ OTel-instrumented agents. <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">Native MCP server</strong> exposes 8 inspection tools to Cursor, Claude Code, and Windsurf \u2014 one config, three clients. Plus filesystem-drop, passive-watch, raw-log-capture.</p>\n        <code style=\"font-size:11px;color:#c79bff;background:#0f0820;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;\">otel-receiver \u00b7 mcp-server \u00b7 capture-pipe</code>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.18);border-radius:12px;padding:24px 22px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.10em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c79bff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;\">Layer 5</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:8px;\">Branching &amp; Simulation</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:12px;\">Branch from any captured state. Simulate alternate paths. What-if any decision your agent made \u2014 explored offline, no live API costs.</p>\n        <code style=\"font-size:11px;color:#c79bff;background:#0f0820;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;\">branch-create \u00b7 simulate \u00b7 replay-branch</code>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(199,155,255,0.10),rgba(199,155,255,0.02));border:1px solid rgba(199,155,255,0.25);border-radius:12px;padding:24px 22px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.10em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c79bff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;\">Built In</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:8px;\">All Local. All Yours.</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:12px;\">No cloud uploads. No telemetry to vendors. Your agent runs, your captures, your memory, your audits \u2014 all stay on your machine. Works offline. Works in air-gapped environments. <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">Ships with the bundle.</strong></p>\n        <code style=\"font-size:11px;color:#c79bff;background:#0f0820;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;\">~/.prime/  \u00b7  open architecture</code>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <p style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:40px;font-size:13px;color:var(--dim);\">\n      <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">Native integrations:</strong> Claude Code (OTEL + MCP), Docker (watch), Git/CI (compare --strict), Cursor (MCP + agent-trace), Windsurf (MCP). One MCP server, three IDE/CLI clients. Plus 50+ OTEL-instrumented frameworks (LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, LlamaIndex, OpenAI Agents SDK, Haystack, DSPy).\n      <span style=\"color:var(--muted);\">\u00b7</span>\n      Not yet supported: hosted UIs (ChatGPT.com, Claude.ai web). See <a href=\"/integrations/\" style=\"color:#c79bff;\">integrations</a> for setup guides.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550 -->\n<!--  AUDIENCE CHOOSER \u2014 route visitor to their dedicated landing page  -->\n<!-- \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550 -->\n<section class=\"chooser\" id=\"chooser\" style=\"padding:80px 0 56px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0a0613 0%,#0e0820 100%);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.15);\">\n  <div class=\"container\" style=\"max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:56px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#a78bfa);border:none;border-radius:100px;padding:11px 24px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(139,92,246,0.45);\">\u2192 Pick your stream \u2190</div>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,54px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.05;margin:0 0 18px;color:#fff;\">Which one are you?</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size:18px;color:rgba(232,216,255,0.82);max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.55;\">Click a tile. Land on a page built for your situation, with setup, pricing, and demos specific to you.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;\">\n\n      <a href=\"/compliance/\" style=\"background:rgba(199,155,255,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(199,155,255,0.18);border-radius:14px;padding:36px 30px;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.2s ease;display:block;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(199,155,255,0.5)';this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)';\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(199,155,255,0.18)';this.style.transform='translateY(0)';\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#22d3ee;margin-bottom:10px;\">For Compliance Teams</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">EU AI Act + SOC 2 audit infrastructure</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(232,216,255,0.78);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 12px;\">Cryptographically-signed audit trails for high-risk AI systems. Multi-vendor, local-first, regulator-verifiable. Free &mdash; reach out at hello@steelspine.ai.</p>\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#c79bff;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.02em;\">View compliance &nbsp;\u2192</div>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/dev/\" style=\"background:rgba(199,155,255,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(199,155,255,0.18);border-radius:14px;padding:36px 30px;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.2s ease;display:block;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(199,155,255,0.5)';this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)';\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(199,155,255,0.18)';this.style.transform='translateY(0)';\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#22d3ee;margin-bottom:10px;\">For AI Devs</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">Debug and replay any agent run</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(232,216,255,0.78);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 12px;\">Wrap any agent. Find where it failed. Replay deterministically. Verify it wasn't tampered with. Free &mdash; reach out at hello@steelspine.ai.</p>\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#c79bff;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.02em;\">View AI Devs &nbsp;\u2192</div>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/gaming/\" style=\"background:rgba(199,155,255,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(199,155,255,0.18);border-radius:14px;padding:36px 30px;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.2s ease;display:block;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(199,155,255,0.5)';this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)';\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(199,155,255,0.18)';this.style.transform='translateY(0)';\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#22d3ee;margin-bottom:10px;\">For Game Studios</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">NPC memory + tamper-proof anti-cheat</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(232,216,255,0.78);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 12px;\">NPCs that remember across sessions. Cryptographically-verified anti-cheat. Replayable world state for evolving questlines. Free &mdash; reach out at hello@steelspine.ai.</p>\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#c79bff;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.02em;\">View Gaming &nbsp;\u2192</div>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/devops/\" style=\"background:rgba(199,155,255,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(199,155,255,0.18);border-radius:14px;padding:36px 30px;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.2s ease;display:block;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(199,155,255,0.5)';this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)';\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(199,155,255,0.18)';this.style.transform='translateY(0)';\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#22d3ee;margin-bottom:10px;\">For DevOps Teams</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">Gate PRs on agent regression</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(232,216,255,0.78);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 12px;\"><code style=\"background:#1a0f2e;color:#c79bff;font-size:0.85em;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;\">compare --strict</code> in CI exits non-zero on regression. GitHub Actions, GitLab, Jenkins. Block bad agent behavior before merge.</p>\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#c79bff;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.02em;\">View DevOps &nbsp;\u2192</div>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/memory/\" style=\"background:rgba(199,155,255,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(199,155,255,0.18);border-radius:14px;padding:36px 30px;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.2s ease;display:block;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(199,155,255,0.5)';this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)';\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(199,155,255,0.18)';this.style.transform='translateY(0)';\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#22d3ee;margin-bottom:10px;\">For AI Builders</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">Local-first persistent memory</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(232,216,255,0.78);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 12px;\">Mem0 / Letta / Zep alternative with local-first storage and cryptographic audit. One URL change. Any OpenAI-compatible LLM.</p>\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#c79bff;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.02em;\">View Memory &nbsp;\u2192</div>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/integrations/\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(199,155,255,0.08),rgba(199,155,255,0.02));border:1px soli